{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_18_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_18","textTraditional":"一、七年，春，二月，己亥，焚咸丘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_18_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_18","textTraditional":"其不言邾咸丘何也？疾其以火攻也。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_18_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_18","textTraditional":"二、夏，穀伯綏來朝。鄧侯吾離來朝。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_18_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_18","textTraditional":"其名何也？失國也。失國則其以朝言之何也？嘗以諸侯與之接矣，雖失國，弗損吾異日也。","sentenceOrder":4}],"overrides":{}}